      "cooked": "<p>Must kill all humans</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-259-disparation-vol-2-108\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-259-disparation-vol-2-108\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-259-disparation-vol-2-108\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode  #259 - Disparation Vol. 2 #108</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Let's get EXTREME again!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:21:52 OK, we get pretty silly with this one, but it's worth it! At least, we think so. I'm just now on my way back from a very successful PAX West, which I'm sure you'll hear all about in next week's...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b394b2438cc57591df69553abe9481145e89a024.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b394b2438cc57591df69553abe9481145e89a024\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b394b2438cc57591df69553abe9481145e89a024_2_323x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pCE2XbS31nk1ZqddE1tD9xdHnQo\" width=\"323\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b394b2438cc57591df69553abe9481145e89a024_2_323x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b394b2438cc57591df69553abe9481145e89a024_2_484x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b394b2438cc57591df69553abe9481145e89a024_2_646x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b394b2438cc57591df69553abe9481145e89a024_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1316×2037 232 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
