      "id": 265037,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2026-02-04T15:50:22.694Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That may have happened later, but the first occurrence of Doritos flavored like Mountain Dew was as a mystery flavor with a guessing sweepstakes.</p>\n<p>Omni-Mars is a better name than Omni-War, IMO, contrary to Christopher claiming that it doesn’t work.</p>\n<p>Omni-Cybertruck.  Thank, own brain, I hate it.</p>\n<p>I like it on a concept level, but Unity really isn’t a metal band name.</p>\n<p>This is the plan!  Get your butt to Mars!</p>\n<p>Am I the only one who wants a The Sentinels-esque deck for these Unity band members?  We got a description for one male member, but it could be a Devra and a Ms. Caspit as separate members, with anyone or anything for the fourth.</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-02-04T16:25:25.828Z",
